{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8ed99f36-be59-4dcf-9e4d-513b1807fbfc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Automated_cadd_pipeline"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "164d1ef1",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "ywtrPI2vYQ2F",
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "## Aim of this talktorial\n",
    "\n",
    "In this talktorial, we will learn how to develop an **automated structure-based virtual screening pipeline**.\n",
    "\n",
    "The pipeline is **particularly suited for the hit expansion and lead optimization** phases of a **drug discovery project**, where a **promising ligand** (i.e. an **initial hit** or **lead compound**) needs to be **structurally modified** in order to improve its **binding affinity** and **selectivity** for the **target protein**. The **general architecture** of the pipeline can thus be summarized as follows (**Figure 1**)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a497aaaa",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "ywtrPI2vYQ2F"
   },
   "source": [
    "* **Input**\n",
    "    * **Target protein structure** and a **promising ligand** (e.g. **lead** or **hit compound**), plus **specifications** of the **processes** that need to be performed.\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Processes**\n",
    "    * **Detection** of the most **druggable binding site** for the given **protein structure**.\n",
    "    * Finding **derivatives** and **structural analogs** for the ligand, and **filtering** them based on **drug-likeness**.\n",
    "    * Performing **docking calculations** on the detected **protein binding site** using the selected **analogs**.\n",
    "    * **Analyzing** and **visualizing** predicted **protein–ligand interactions** and **binding modes** for each **analog**.\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Output**\n",
    "    * **New ligand structure(s)** optimized for **binding affinity**, **selectivity**, and **drug-likeness**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6eb90871-f242-4c21-840e-b77073ecb50d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "![Pipeline overview](https://projects.volkamerlab.org/teachopencadd/_images/sb_vs_pipeline.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "*Figure 1*: General architecture of the automated structure-based virtual screening pipeline."
   ]
  },
